WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.088
Shipping is where many online sales are lost.

00:00:04.088 --> 00:00:09.294
This video shows why the Shipping module exists, how zones, methods and settings

00:00:09.294 --> 00:00:14.440
fit together, and how to use every screen, from a zone to recording a shipment.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.377
Shipping is where many online sales are lost.

00:00:22.377 --> 00:00:26.760
A surprise price, no option that fits the order, or no way to

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.770
collect it nearby, and the buyer leaves.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:35.368
Doing it by hand means quoting every order, writing tracking numbers into emails,

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.430
and hoping the parcel went out.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:42.419
The Shipping module offers each buyer the methods that fit their address and

00:00:42.419 --> 00:00:45.210
their order, with the price worked out for them.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:50.385
Afterwards you pack the order, record the shipment with its tracking number, and

00:00:50.385 --> 00:00:51.620
the buyer is told.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.941
A zone is a place you ship to.

00:00:57.941 --> 00:01:01.240
Each zone has the methods buyers there can choose.

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:05.157
A method is a way to ship and what it costs:

00:01:05.157 --> 00:01:10.730
a flat rate, a table rate, free shipping, local delivery, or a carrier's own rate.

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:17.156
Settings, Commerce, Shipping holds the weight unit, the pickup locations, where you ship

00:01:17.156 --> 00:01:19.330
from, and the carrier account.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.260
Shipping, Try rates checks your setup, and each order page records the shipments.

00:01:29.463 --> 00:01:30.741
Open Shipping.

00:01:30.741 --> 00:01:33.041
A zone is a place you ship to.

00:01:33.041 --> 00:01:35.086
The list shows your zones.

00:01:35.086 --> 00:01:37.003
Click Add Shipping Zone.

00:01:37.455 --> 00:01:41.141
Enter a Name, and choose the Countries the zone covers.

00:01:41.141 --> 00:01:45.674
Rest of the world covers every country that no other zone covers, and

00:01:45.674 --> 00:01:48.635
Position decides which zone is tried first.

00:01:49.087 --> 00:01:50.139
Click Save.

00:01:50.139 --> 00:01:53.046
The zone opens with its Shipping methods.

00:01:53.046 --> 00:01:59.047
Zones are tried from the smallest position, and the first zone that covers an address wins.

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:06.140
Under Shipping methods, click Add method.

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:09.050
A flat rate charges one amount per order.

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:13.385
A table rate looks the amount up from weight, subtotal or items.

00:02:13.385 --> 00:02:19.205
Free shipping charges nothing, and local delivery and carrier rates are the other kinds.

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:20.630
Choose Flat rate.

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:22.936
Name it Standard shipping.

00:02:22.936 --> 00:02:27.171
Amount per order is charged once for the order, and Amount per item

00:02:27.171 --> 00:02:28.853
is added for each item.

00:02:28.853 --> 00:02:31.754
On turns the method off without deleting it.

00:02:31.754 --> 00:02:32.740
Click Save.

00:02:33.191 --> 00:02:35.243
Add a Free shipping method too.

00:02:35.243 --> 00:02:39.681
Free from a subtotal of sets how much a buyer spends before it is offered.

00:02:39.681 --> 00:02:43.731
Buyers see the methods that are on, in the order of their Position.

00:02:47.916 --> 00:02:50.847
Weight-based rates need weights.

00:02:50.847 --> 00:02:55.936
On a product, Weight (kg) is the weight of one unit, packed.

00:02:56.389 --> 00:02:59.161
Settings, Commerce, Shipping has tabs.

00:02:59.161 --> 00:03:04.326
On General, the Weight unit is kilograms or pounds, and the Shipping classes

00:03:04.326 --> 00:03:07.979
are the classes you can give products, one per line.

00:03:08.431 --> 00:03:12.856
Also on General, Tracking links turns a carrier and a tracking number into

00:03:12.856 --> 00:03:17.501
a link, and Email the buyer when a shipment leaves sends the tracking details.

00:03:21.747 --> 00:03:25.974
On the Store pickup tab, add a pickup location with a Name, a

00:03:25.974 --> 00:03:28.939
Fee, an address and What buyers are told.

00:03:28.939 --> 00:03:32.597
Buyers can then choose to collect their order there.

00:03:33.063 --> 00:03:37.631
On the Sending parcels tab, the Sender's name and the address under it

00:03:37.631 --> 00:03:39.734
say where parcels leave from.

00:03:39.734 --> 00:03:44.483
The default box size and the Box weight pack parcels when you buy labels.

00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:49.521
On the EasyPost tab, Enable EasyPost provider and an API key let you

00:03:49.521 --> 00:03:52.665
offer the carriers' own rates and buy labels.

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:57.968
On the Providers tab, the Default carrier provider chooses which account to use.

00:04:02.171 --> 00:04:05.769
Shipping, Try rates shows what a buyer would see.

00:04:05.769 --> 00:04:10.742
Choose a Country, a Region code and a Currency, then enter the order's

00:04:10.742 --> 00:04:12.901
Subtotal, Weight and Items.

00:04:13.351 --> 00:04:14.598
Click Show rates.

00:04:14.598 --> 00:04:18.611
Each method that applies is listed with what it would charge, so you

00:04:18.611 --> 00:04:21.321
can check your zones before a customer does.

00:04:25.498 --> 00:04:26.971
Open a paid order.

00:04:26.971 --> 00:04:31.390
Under New shipment, each Item shows how many are Left to ship, and

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:33.538
how many go In this shipment.

00:04:34.009 --> 00:04:38.941
Enter the Carrier, the Tracking number and, if you have one, a Tracking link.

00:04:38.941 --> 00:04:41.139
Note for the store is optional.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:42.644
It has left:

00:04:42.644 --> 00:04:46.511
mark it shipped now is ticked when the parcel is on its way.

00:04:46.511 --> 00:04:48.152
Click Create shipment.

00:04:48.152 --> 00:04:51.550
The order lists the shipment, and the buyer is told.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.259
Domestic and abroad:

00:04:57.259 --> 00:05:01.033
one zone for your country with a flat rate, and one for the

00:05:01.033 --> 00:05:03.530
rest of the world with a higher rate.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.758
Free shipping to win bigger orders:

00:05:06.758 --> 00:05:09.660
a free method that starts from a subtotal.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.530
Heavy goods:

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:14.830
a table rate that looks the price up by weight.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.142
Click and collect:

00:05:17.142 --> 00:05:22.350
a pickup location with no fee, and local delivery for nearby postal codes.

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:28.657
Set up zones and methods once, check them with Try rates, and record

00:05:28.657 --> 00:05:30.927
every shipment against its order.

00:05:30.927 --> 00:05:32.440
Thanks for watching.

